  "name": "Clockwork Crisis",
  "description": "A two-scenario sample campaign: stop the Clockmaker, then face Rhino with the parts you took from his workshop. Shows a campaign log with a number and a flag, written between games and read in a game's setup.",
  "tagline": "A story in two issues",
  "definition": {
